<title>FINLAND: Huhtamaki 1996 profit rises 33 percent.</title>
<headline>Huhtamaki 1996 profit rises 33 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   416 vs 312</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  10.29 vs 7.56</p>
<p> Net sales					  7,505 vs 7,836</p>
<p> Operating profit				   529 vs 465</p>
<p> Proposed dividend (markka)		    4.50 vs 4.00</p>
<p>NOTE - The median forecast for Finnish confectionery and packaging materials group Huhtamaki Oy was for a 431 million markka profit.  </p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 104 vs 132 charge</p>
<p>Share on equity of</p>
<p>  associated companies		     charge 9 vs 21 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						  120 vs 89</p>
<p> Extraordinary income			   1,014 vs 1</p>
<p> Extraordinary expense			    393 vs 44</p>
<p> Net profit					   421 vs 180</p>
<p>NOTE - Income statement IAS. Company's full name is Huhtamaki Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0245</p>
</text>
